                                "sense_id": "5978a05b-be7a-3770-929d-d51c9c50ee9d",
                                "text": "A description of Mr. Garrard's Antimeter, or Reflecting Circle, may be seen in his pamphlet, published in 1785; and in the article Antimeter, by the Author of this work"
